ch('llorona_ti_sup', [("her long hair and the torn dress lifting and floating as if under water; rings of pale blue light pulse out from the lantern, each fading before it is wider than her shoulders","her long hair and the torn dress stirring as if in a slow current; one soft ring of pale blue light pulses around the lantern, no wider than the lantern itself, and fades")], fit="The lantern never rises above her chin. Her hair stays below the top of her head and close to her body. The light stays on the lantern.")
