ch('atlas_ti_atk', [("he bends his knees and heaves the great sword up with both hands until the hilt is beside his right shoulder, the blade leaning back over that shoulder","he bends his knees and lifts the great sword straight up with both hands until the hilt is at chest height, the blade still pointing down in front of him"),("he steps his left foot forward, bends the front knee deep and brings the sword down in one heavy diagonal chop in front of his body, the blade ending low with its point near the ground at his left side; a blue-white light runs along the blade during the chop and fades","he steps his left foot forward, bends the front knee deep and drives the point of the sword down hard into the ground in front of his feet; a blue-white light runs along the blade at the impact and fades"),("draws the sword back in front of him, point down,","keeps the sword in front of him, point down,")], fit="The whole sword stays inside the frame and in front of his body for the whole clip. The light stays on the blade.")
