ch('vanhelsing_ti_hyp', [("raises the rifle to his shoulder, aiming it straight at the viewer, his coat swinging","raises the rifle to his shoulder and points the barrel straight into the camera, so that the round hole of the muzzle faces the viewer, his coat swinging"),("a short puff of gun smoke rolls out of the muzzle, thins out and fades; there is no fire and no light at the muzzle, only the smoke","a short puff of gray gun smoke rolls out of the muzzle, thins out and fades; there is no fire and no light at the muzzle, only the gray smoke")], addfit="His face stays visible above the rifle.")
