ch('surt_ti_sup', [("planting the blade point down between his feet, his head lowering","planting the blade point down between his feet, his head up and his eyes on the viewer"),("and a single flame rises from the pommel no higher than his chin","and a single small flame burns on the pommel, no higher than his chin")], fit="The sword stays point down in front of him and never rises above his chest. The fire stays on the blade: nothing shoots upward. His face is visible in every frame.")
